atus":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0177","start":177,"end":181,"surface":"昭王夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001962","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0183","start":183,"end":185,"surface":"白公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001940","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0194","start":194,"end":196,"surface":"葉公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001943","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0200","start":200,"end":203,"surface":"楚惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001916","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0208","start":208,"end":210,"surface":"白公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001940","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0214","start":214,"end":216,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001916","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p056","text":"十三年，呉王夫差彊，陵齊、晉，來伐楚。十六年，越滅呉。四十二年，楚滅蔡。四十四年，楚滅杞。與秦平。是時越已滅呉而不能正江、淮北；楚東侵，廣地至泗上。五十七年，惠王卒，子簡王中立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m056-0004","start":4,"end":8,"surface":"呉王夫差","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002024","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m056-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001916","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m056-0084","start":84,"end":87,"surface":"簡王中","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001917","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p051","text":"十四年，宋景公滅曹。二十年，齊田常弒其君簡公，而常相於齊。二十二年，楚惠王滅陳。孔子卒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m0